# Claude Code working tree — DENY BY DEFAULT, allow-list the exceptions.
# Written this way round on purpose: this directory holds
# settings.local.json (machine-local credentials and standing tool approvals)
# and .claude/worktrees/ (>1 GB of live git worktrees). An ignore list that
# names what to EXCLUDE would leak the next thing anyone drops in here; this
# one leaks nothing unless a human adds a `!` line on purpose.
#
# Tracked, and why:
#   bin/          the lane + promotion tooling. It has to travel with the repo,
#                 or a lane cannot see the rules that govern promoting it.
#   qc/QC_LEDGER.md  the findings record — the durable output of QC work.
# Deliberately NOT tracked:
#   qc/QUEUE-review.md  the post-commit hook appends to it on every commit, so
#                 tracking it would leave the tree dirty immediately after each
#                 commit and quietly erode the clean-tree precondition for
#                 merging. It is regenerable from git log + the ledger watermark.
#   qc/DIGEST-*.md      generated each morning; reproducible, not evidence.
.claude/*
!.claude/bin/
!.claude/qc/
.claude/qc/*
!.claude/qc/QC_LEDGER.md

# Node data directories
src/commputer-testnet/
